# Overdue in the left pane and the Logbook with completed hidden in the right one come back after quitting and reopening, the right pane focused.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today-2})
	- Ship release @done({today-1})
END
keys gO <C-w> s gL gc
see ✔ Ship release
restart
see 󰨱 Overdue
see 󱓳 Logbook
see ▌ ✔ Ship release  Work
keys x
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today-2})
	- Ship release
END
